    <string name="about_features_title">Features</string>
    <string name="about_features_body">Notix is a local notification-blocking tool.\n· Block notifications: block notifications from selected apps in the notification shade (requires notification access permission).\n· Rule-based filtering: create rules by app, keyword, time, charging state, screen state, etc., to mute or replace notifications.\n· History: review blocked and processed notifications in the History tab, and clear them manually.\n· Rule import/export: back up rules as a JSON file, or restore rules from a file.\n· Crash log: built-in crash log entry for troubleshooting.</string>

